# This project requires NO environment variables to install, test or run.
# The CHANGELOG generator is a standard-library-only CLI with no credentials.
#
# SECURITY: never put real values in this file and never commit a populated
# .env. The repository's .gitignore excludes .env and .env.* (except this
# example) so local secrets cannot be committed by accident.
#
# - Opire / Stripe payout credentials stay with the bounty operator only.
# - Claude API keys for workflow bounties belong in the workflow's secret store.
# - Any token needed by CI belongs in GitHub Actions secrets, never in source.
#
# Optional, non-secret release metadata consumed by `docker compose run`:
# (leave unset to use the defaults declared in docker-compose.yml)
# RELEASE_VERSION=0.1.0
# RELEASE_DATE=1970-01-01
